From bb9945bcbca0d41f43bea4f968120d983115ba2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 01:50:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tools: record GGML_ARIFI_ROCMFPX_FORMATS in the build-recipe
 snapshot

Adding a CMake option adds a cache entry, so the committed recipe snapshot
went stale the moment the option landed: recipe diff reported exactly one
difference, the new key. Refreshed at the option's DEFAULT (OFF), so the
snapshot keeps describing the default build rather than whatever arm was
last configured. recipe diff is PASS again, 310/310.

The two header lines also change: the previous snapshot was exported from a
worktree and recorded a relative source path. This one was exported from the
repo root.

Origin: ArifiLabs/rocmfp-weight-formats
Evidence: research/local-inference/trial-evidence/110/
Measured-effect: generated artifact only; no source or engine behaviour changed
---
 tools/arifi-sync/recipe/build-vulkan.cache-snapshot.txt | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/arifi-sync/recipe/build-vulkan.cache-snapshot.txt b/tools/arifi-sync/recipe/build-vulkan.cache-snapshot.txt
index d1d8edf04..fff83aa79 100644
--- a/tools/arifi-sync/recipe/build-vulkan.cache-snapshot.txt
+++ b/tools/arifi-sync/recipe/build-vulkan.cache-snapshot.txt
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # ArifiLabs build recipe snapshot - GENERATED, do not hand-edit.
-# Source: ../arifilabs-llama.cpp/build-vulkan/CMakeCache.txt
-# Captured: 2026-07-24T22:58:43+00:00
+# Source: build-vulkan/CMakeCache.txt
+# Captured: 2026-07-25T05:49:28+00:00
 # Non-INTERNAL / non-STATIC CMake cache entries only.
 # Compare a new build against this with: arifi_sync.py recipe diff
 AZ_DISABLE_ASSERT:BOOL=OFF
@@ -135,6 +135,7 @@ GGML_ALL_WARNINGS_3RD_PARTY:BOOL=OFF
 GGML_AMX_BF16:BOOL=OFF
 GGML_AMX_INT8:BOOL=OFF
 GGML_AMX_TILE:BOOL=OFF
+GGML_ARIFI_ROCMFPX_FORMATS:BOOL=OFF
 GGML_AVX:BOOL=OFF
 GGML_AVX2:BOOL=OFF
 GGML_AVX512:BOOL=OFF
